          "_name": "menu01",
          "_sourceTheme": "glancem5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"menu menu01 glancem5\" group=\"Menu\" plugins=\"DropDown, TouchSwipe\" always-top global once=\"menu\" not-draggable position-absolute>\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Logo\" name=\"showLogo\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" title=\"Logo Size\" inline name=\"logoSize\" min=\"3\" max=\"8\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"8\" condition=\"showLogo\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Brand Name\" name=\"showBrand\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Menu Items\" name=\"showItems\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Active Color\" name=\"activeColor\" value=\"#c75423\" condition=\"showItems\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" name=\"borderColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"showItems\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Icons\" name=\"showIcons\">\n        <select title=\"Amount\" name=\"iconsAmount\" condition=\"showIcons\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\" selected>2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icons Color\" name=\"iconsColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"showIcons\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Button\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <header>Styles</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Sticky\" name=\"sticky\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Collapsed\" name=\"collapsed\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Transparent\" name=\"transparent\">\n        <input type=\"range\" title=\"Opacity\" name=\"opacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"transparent\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"menuBgColor\" value=\"#101012\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Hamburger\" name=\"hamburgerColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <nav class=\"navbar navbar-dropdown\" mbr-class=\"{'navbar-fixed-top':sticky,\n                     'navbar-expand-lg':!collapsed,\n                     'collapsed':collapsed}\">\n        <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\" class=\"content-wrap\">\n            <div class=\"navbar-brand\">\n                <span mbr-if=\"showLogo\" class=\"navbar-logo\">\n                    <a href=\"https://neutral3rd.space\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/white20and20orange20n320logo-1206x1206.png\" alt=\"Neutral3rd Emerging Tech Development Studio\" mbr-style=\"{'height': logoSize + 'rem'}\">\n                    </a>\n                </span>\n                <span mbr-if=\"showBrand\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" class=\"navbar-caption-wrap\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd,-mbrBtnRemove,-iconFont\"><a class=\"navbar-caption text-info\" data-app-selector=\".navbar-caption\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">GlanceM5</a></span>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"navbar-toggler\" type=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#navbarSupportedContent\" data-bs-target=\"#navbarSupportedContent\" aria-controls=\"navbarNavAltMarkup\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation\" mbr-if=\"showItems || showIcons || showButtons\">\n                <div class=\"hamburger\">\n                    <span></span>\n                    <span></span>\n                    <span></span>\n                    <span></span>\n                </div>\n            </button>\n            <div class=\"collapse navbar-collapse\" id=\"navbarSupportedContent\" mbr-if=\"showItems || showIcons || showButtons\">\n                <ul mbr-menu class=\"navbar-nav nav-dropdown\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showItems\" mbr-class=\"{'nav-right': !showButtons,'navbar-nav-top-padding': isPublish && !showBrand && !showLogo}\"><li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link link text-info text-primary\" href=\"https://offerbeacon.neutral3rd.space\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">OfferBeacon Suite</a></li><li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link link text-info text-primary\" href=\"https://neutral3rd.space/custom-task-prompt\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">From My Wildest Dreams</a></li>\n                    \n                    <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link link text-info text-primary\" href=\"index.html#dev-about\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">About</a>\n                    </li></ul>\n                <div class=\"icons-menu\" mbr-if=\"showIcons\">\n                    <a class=\"iconfont-wrapper\" href=\"index.html\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"p-2 mbr-iconfont socicon-bluesky socicon\"></span>\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"iconfont-wrapper\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" target=\"_blank\" mbr-if=\"iconsAmount > 1\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"p-2 mbr-iconfont socicon-twitter socicon\"></span>\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"iconfont-wrapper\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" target=\"_blank\" mbr-if=\"iconsAmount > 2\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"p-2 mbr-iconfont socicon-instagram socicon\"></span>\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"iconfont-wrapper\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" target=\"_blank\" mbr-if=\"iconsAmount > 3\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"p-2 mbr-iconfont socicon-linkedin socicon\"></span>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                <div mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"navbar-buttons mbr-section-btn\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://studioguide.neutral3rd.space/chat?token=cf7573456c87d54489c7ba5f0a2e93bf&name=Samir%20%7C%20Neutral3rd%20Emerging%20Tech%20Development%20Studio&accent=%23c75423&greet=Hey!%20Welcome%20to%20Neutral3rd.%20I%27m%20Samir%2C%20Neutral3rd%27s%20AI%20studio%20guide.%20I%20can%20help%20you%20explore%20the%20OfferBeacon%20Suite%2C%20learn%20about%20this%20development%20studio%20in%20general%2C%20or%20find%20the%20right%20next%20step.%20What%20brings%20you%20here%20today%3F&face=https%3A%2F%2Fcuevueapp.com%2Fassets%2Ffaces%2Fstandard%2F62227bb3-2f6e-4220-b3c9-2c02b2fdb349.jpg&page=https%3A%2F%2Fstudioguide.neutral3rd.space%2Fneutral3rd-emerging-technologies%2Fsamir-from-neutral3rd-emerging&mode=desktop&lang=en\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Start a Conversation</a></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vyYeEjo760",
          "_anchor": "menu01-3o",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": true,
          "_once": "menu",
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)",
              "& when (@overlay)": {
                ".mbr-overlay": {
                  "background": "@overlayColor",
                  "opacity": "@overlayOpacity"
                }
              }
            },
            "& when (@fullWidth)": {
              ".container-fluid": {
                "padding": "0 32px",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "padding": "0 24px"
                }
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
              ".container": {
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "padding": "0 24px"
                }
              }
            },
            ".card": {
              "justify-content": "center"
            },
            ".title-wrapper": {
              "padding": "0 32px 32px",
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "padding": "0 24px 24px"
              },
              ".mbr-section-title": {
                "margin-bottom": "16px"
              },
              ".mbr-desc": {
                "margin-bottom": "0"
              }
            },
            ".text-wrapper": {
              "border-top": "1px solid @border",
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "space-between",
              "padding": "32px",
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "display": "block",
                "padding": "24px"
              },
              ".mbr-text": {
                "width": "45%",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "width": "100%",
                  "margin-bottom": "24px",
                  "&:last-child": {
                    "margin-bottom": "0"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#F9F6E0"
            },
            ".mbr-desc": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".mbr-section-btn": {
              "text-align": "right"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            }
          },
          "_name": "article04",
          "_sourceTheme": "fabm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article04 fabm5\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Description\" name=\"showDesc\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text 1\" name=\"showText_1\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text 2\" name=\"showText_2\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" value=\"#72716b\" name=\"border\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax required>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#000000\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.1\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showDesc\">\n                <div class=\"title-wrapper\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                        <b>Privacy</b></h2>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-desc mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-desc\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\">\n                        <a href=\"https://neutral3rd.space\" class=\"text-warning\">Neutral3rd Emerging Tech Development Studio</a>\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText_1\">Effective Date: July 24, 2026<br>Last Updated: November 17, 2026<br><br>1. Introduction\n<br>Neutral3rd (\"Neutral3rd,\" \"we,\" \"our,\" or \"us\") is an independent emerging technologies development studio providing artificial intelligence (AI) enablement, software development, automation, digital communications, content systems, accessibility, and related professional services. Neutral3rd is a brand of Rowdy Independents LLC and operates from the United States.\n<br>\n<br>We recognize that privacy, transparency, and responsible data handling are essential to building trustworthy digital experiences.\n<br>\n<br>This Privacy Policy explains how personal information is collected, used, disclosed, retained, and protected when individuals visit this website, contact us, purchase products or services, participate in consultations, or interact with digital solutions that we operate.\n<br>\n<br>This policy applies to this web space (https://neutral3rd.space) and other Neutral3rd-operated services that expressly link to it. A separately operated product, client implementation, or third-party platform may have its own privacy notice.\n<br>\n<br>By using this website, you acknowledge the practices described in this policy. Where applicable law requires consent, we will seek it separately.\n<br>\n<br>2. Information We May Collect\n<br>2.1 Information You Provide Directly\n<br>Depending on your interaction with Neutral3rd, we may collect:\n<br>\n<br>- Name, business name, and professional title.\n<br>- Email address, telephone number, and preferred contact method.\n<br>- Business website and publicly available business information.\n<br>- Information submitted through contact forms, intake questionnaires, consultations, and support requests.\n<br>- Project requirements, goals, preferences, and technical specifications.\n<br>- Materials you upload or send for a project, including documents, images, and examples of your work.\n<br>- Billing, transaction, and purchase-related information.\n<br>- Communications, feedback, and correspondence.\n<br>- Recordings of project sessions, where a session is recorded.\n<br>- Information voluntarily provided when requesting access to or participating in a demonstration.\n<br>You should avoid submitting passwords, financial account credentials, government identification numbers, protected health information, or other sensitive personal information unless we have expressly requested it through an appropriate secure process.\n<br>\n<br>2.2 Information Collected Automatically\n<br>When you visit our website, our hosting provider and any enabled website technologies may collect technical information, including:\n<br>\n<br>- IP address and approximate geographic region.\n<br>- Browser type, device type, and operating system.\n<br>- Pages visited and referral sources.\n<br>- Date, time, and duration of website interactions.\n<br>- Error reports, diagnostic information, and performance data.\n<br>- Cookie identifiers and similar technical identifiers, where applicable.\n<br>The specific information collected depends on the technologies active on the website.\n<br>\n<br>2.3 Information From Other Sources\n<br>We may receive business-related information from publicly accessible websites, business directories, professional networks, referrals, and authorized third-party integrations.\n<br>\n<br>We use such information for legitimate business purposes, subject to applicable laws and platform restrictions.\n<br>\n<br>3. How Information Is Used\n<br>We may process information to:\n<br>\n<br>- Respond to inquiries and provide customer support.\n<br>- Evaluate project requirements and prepare proposals.\n<br>- Provide consulting, implementation, training, and development services.\n<br>- Build, test, and deliver the prompts, documents, and presentations prepared for a project.\n<br>- Schedule and hold project sessions.\n<br>- Process purchases, subscriptions, and related transactions.\n<br>- Deliver purchased digital products and service communications.\n<br>- Maintain business records and fulfill contractual obligations.\n<br>- Monitor website reliability, diagnose technical problems, and improve user experiences.\n<br>- Protect against fraud, abuse, unauthorized access, and security incidents.\n<br>- Comply with applicable legal obligations.\n<br>- Send optional promotional communications where permitted by law and consistent with your communication preferences.\n<br>We do not require you to subscribe to promotional emails as a condition of requesting ordinary support.\n<br>\n<br>4. Artificial Intelligence &amp; Automated Systems\n<br>Neutral3rd develops and implements AI-enabled solutions, including conversational business guides, workflow automations, and information-retrieval systems.\n<br>\n<br>When an AI-enabled service is used, submitted content may be processed by the underlying AI model provider, hosting service, integration platform, or other authorized technology provider.\n<br>\n<br>Depending on the solution, processed information may include user questions, business information, conversation content, and technical interaction data.\n<br>\n<br>4.1 Client Business Information\n<br>Clients may authorize us to use approved business content, such as product descriptions, policies, service information, frequently asked questions, and website content, to configure an AI solution.\n<br>\n<br>We intend to use this information within the scope of the agreed services and client authorization.\n<br>\n<br>4.2 Personal Information in AI Conversations\n<br>Users should not enter sensitive or confidential personal information into an AI interface unless the interface explicitly supports that use and provides appropriate privacy safeguards.\n<br>\n<br>AI-generated responses may contain inaccuracies and should be independently verified when used for consequential decisions.\n<br>\n<br>4.3 AI Provider Practices\n<br>Third-party AI providers may have independent data-processing, retention, monitoring, and model-improvement practices. Those practices depend on the provider, product, configuration, and contractual terms.\n<br>\n<br>Neutral3rd does not represent that all third-party AI interactions are private, zero-retention, or excluded from model training unless such protections have been specifically verified for the relevant service.\n<br>\n<br>4.4 Client-Controlled Implementations\n<br>Where a client operates its own AI application, website, account, or data environment, that client may independently determine the purposes and means of processing personal information.\n<br>\n<br>In such cases, the client's privacy policy and our applicable service agreement may govern the respective responsibilities.\n<br>\n<br>5. Cookies &amp; Similar Technologies\n<br>This website may use cookies, local storage, and similar technologies for essential functionality, performance, analytics, and user preferences.\n<br>\n<br>These technologies may be used to maintain website functionality, measure traffic, identify technical errors, or support integrations.\n<br>\n<br>Where required by applicable law, we will provide appropriate notice and choices for nonessential technologies.\n<br>\n<br>You may also manage cookies through your browser settings. Disabling certain technologies may affect website functionality.\n<br>\n<br>6. Payments &amp; Transactions\n<br>Neutral3rd uses third-party payment processors, including Stripe, to facilitate purchases, subscriptions, invoices, and refunds.\n<br>\n<br>Payment processors collect payment card information, billing addresses, transaction identifiers, and fraud-prevention information under their own terms and privacy policies. Card numbers are entered on the processor's page and are not stored by Neutral3rd.\n<br>\n<br>We receive transaction confirmations, payment status, the name, business name, email address, billing address and telephone number you supply at checkout, and limited payment-method information such as the card brand and last four digits, as needed for customer service, accounting, and dispute records.\n<br>\n<br>We do not collect or store complete payment card numbers through our website, forms, or email.\n<br>\n<br>Where an offer states that a fee is not refundable in cash and instead becomes credit, that term is set out in our Terms of Service and is shown before you pay.\n<br>\n<br>Where the check described in section 7 of our Terms finds that a task is not one prompt's worth of work, the outcome is recorded as credit against the name and email address that paid. That record is kept with the payment record so the credit can be honoured later.<br><br>7. From My Wildest Dreams: What We Hold\n<br>This section describes the data handled by the From My Wildest Dreams project. It adds detail to the sections above; it does not replace them.\n<br>\n<br>7.1 What you send before paying\n<br>The short first form asks for your name, business name, email address, website, and a description of the task you want a prompt for. It also records your agreement to the project terms, with the date and time.\n<br>\n<br>Checkout adds the billing details your card issuer requires, as described in section 6.\n<br>\n<br>7.2 What you send after paying\n<br>Once payment has gone through, the full questionnaire asks about your business, the task, the rules and exceptions the prompt must follow, and examples of your work. You may also upload files or paste examples.\n<br>\n<br>Those answers are used to write your brief, build and test your prompt, prepare your session, and produce the documents you keep.\n<br>\n<br>When your answers arrive we review them against what one prompt can be and record the outcome: that the task fits, or that it becomes credit. You hear that outcome within one business day. The booking link is sent after the outcome, so a session is only booked for a task that has passed the check.\n<br>\n<br>If you book a session, the booking records your chosen time in our calendar, together with your name and email address.<br><br>\n7.3 What we create\n<br>For each project we create a folder in our Google Drive containing your brief, the documents prepared for your session, your prompt and workbench files, and a record of the payment.\n<br>\n<br>The payment record holds the amount, the date, the processor's transaction reference, the terms you accepted, and confirmation that the terms were shown to you. It exists so that a question about the payment can be answered from the record.\n<br>\n<br>The prompt we write is delivered into your own Claude, Google, or OpenAI account, together with the documents you keep. That account belongs to you and is governed by that provider's terms. We do not hold your login for it, and we cannot see the account after the session unless you share it with us.<br></p>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText_2\">7.4 How long we keep it\n<br>- <b>Project folder and deliverables:</b> kept while the project is active and for three years after delivery, for support, the Second Look, and any dispute.\n<br>- <b>Payment records:</b> kept for seven years, which covers tax and accounting requirements.\n<br><b>- Session booking:</b> held in the calendar for the period above.\n<br><b>- Emails:</b> held in our mail account for the period above unless you ask us to delete them sooner.\n<br><b>- Second Look:</b> the 30-day window closes on schedule whether or not it is used.\n<br><b>- Check outcome and credit records:</b> kept with the project and payment records, for the periods above, so a credit is not lost and a scope question can be answered later.\n<br><b>- Session recordings:</b> kept in the project folder for the project period above, unless you ask us to delete one sooner.\n<br><br>7.5 What happens to an unpaid project\n<br>A request that has not been paid is held for up to three days, with up to three reminders. If it is still unpaid after that, the project is closed, the working folder created for it is removed, and any single-use payment link for it is cancelled.\n<br>\n<br>A removed folder goes to the Drive trash and can be restored for up to 30 days before it is purged. The record that you made a request, and that it was closed, stays in our project list.\n<br>\n<br>You can ask us to delete that record at any time, subject to section 12.\n<br>\n<br>7.6 Session recordings\n<br>Project sessions are recorded and the recording is shared with you. It is kept in your project folder for the period in section 7.4.\n<br>\n<br>A recording captures what is shown on screen during the session, the voices in it, your camera picture if your camera is on, and any material either of us shows. It is used for the same purposes as the rest of the project record: to deliver the session, to answer a question afterwards, and to resolve a dispute.\n<br>\n<br>If you do not want a session recorded, tell us before the session is booked and we will tell you what is possible before you pay. You may also ask us to delete a recording earlier than section 7.4 provides, subject to section 12.<br><br>8. When We Share Information\n<br>We may disclose information to:\n<br>\n<br>- Hosting and infrastructure providers.\n<br>- Payment and billing processors, including Stripe.\n<br>- Email, scheduling, and communication providers, including Google Workspace and our mail provider.\n<br>- The video meeting and recording service used for project sessions.\n<br>- Document, storage, and form providers, including Google Drive, Google Sheets, Google Forms, Google Docs, and Google Slides.\n<br>- Customer management, support, and workflow automation services, including our client support portal.\n<br>AI model and application providers involved in authorized services.\n<br>- Contractors or professional advisers who require access for legitimate business purposes.\n<br>- Government authorities or other parties when disclosure is required by applicable law.\n<br>- Parties involved in a lawful business reorganization, subject to applicable protections.\n<br>We may also disclose information at your direction or with your authorization.\n<br>\n<br>We do not sell personal information, and we do not share it for cross-context behavioral advertising.\n<br>\n<br>We do not disclose personal information to unrelated parties merely because they request it.\n<br>\n<br>9. Third-Party Websites &amp; Integrations\n<br>This website may link to external services, including AI platforms, payment processors, professional networks, software providers, and educational resources.\n<br>\n<br>These websites operate independently and may have different privacy practices.\n<br>\n<br>A link does not necessarily indicate endorsement, affiliation, or responsibility for a third party's data handling.\n<br>\n<br>We encourage you to review the applicable privacy policies before submitting information to external services.\n<br>\n<br>10. Data Security\n<br>Neutral3rd recognizes the importance of protecting personal and business information.\n<br>\n<br>We seek to apply reasonable administrative, technical, and organizational safeguards appropriate to the nature of the information, the services provided, and the risks involved.\n<br>\n<br>These may include access restrictions, account security measures, appropriate use of secure service providers, and procedures for identifying and addressing security concerns.\n<br>\n<br>Access to project records is limited to Neutral3rd and the studio's own automation. Payment card data is held by the payment processor rather than by us.\n<br>\n<br>No internet transmission, cloud service, or electronic storage system can be guaranteed completely secure.\n<br>\n<br>If you believe information associated with Neutral3rd has been exposed or accessed without authorization, contact privacy@neutral3rd.space.\n<br>\n<br>Where applicable law requires notification of a qualifying data breach, we will address those requirements.\n<br>\n<br>11. Data Retention\n<br>We retain information for periods reasonably necessary to provide requested services, administer business relationships, meet contractual commitments, maintain appropriate records, resolve disputes, and comply with applicable law.\n<br>\n<br>Section 7.4 sets the periods for the From My Wildest Dreams project. Other work is retained on the same principles, for the length of the engagement and the record-keeping period that follows it.\n<br>\n<br>Retention periods may vary according to the category of information, contractual requirements, service-provider settings, and legal obligations.\n<br>\n<br>When information is no longer required, we will seek to delete, de-identify, or securely dispose of it as appropriate, subject to lawful exceptions and technical limitations.\n<br>\n<br>Information held independently by third-party providers may remain subject to their retention policies.\n<br>\n<br>12. Your Privacy Choices &amp; Rights\n<br>Depending on your location and applicable law, you may have rights to:\n<br>\n<br>- Request information about personal data we maintain.\n<br>- Request access to or correction of certain information.\n<br>- Request deletion of eligible information.\n<br>- Withdraw consent where processing depends on consent.\n<br>- Object to or restrict certain processing activities.\n<br>- Opt out of marketing communications.\n<br>- Exercise other privacy rights established by applicable law.\n<br>These rights are not absolute and may be subject to legal, security, contractual, and recordkeeping exceptions. For example, a payment record may need to be kept for tax purposes even after a project is deleted.\n<br>\n<br>To submit a privacy request, email privacy@neutral3rd.space with sufficient information for us to understand and evaluate your request.\n<br>\n<br>We may need to verify your identity before disclosing or modifying personal information. We will respond in accordance with applicable legal requirements.\n<br>\n<br>Marketing Preferences\n<br>If you receive promotional email communications from us, you may use the unsubscribe mechanism provided or contact us directly.\n<br>\n<br>Administrative communications about purchases, security, or active services may still be necessary.\n<br>\n<br>13. Children's Privacy\n<br>Neutral3rd's website and professional services are directed primarily toward adults and business users.\n<br>\n<br>We do not knowingly solicit personal information directly from children under 13 through our general website.\n<br>\n<br>If you believe a child has submitted personal information without appropriate authorization, contact privacy@neutral3rd.space so that we can review the matter.\n<br>\n<br>14. International Visitors\n<br>Neutral3rd operates from the United States.\n<br>\n<br>Information submitted through our website or services may be processed in the United States or other locations where our authorized service providers operate.\n<br>\n<br>Privacy laws and data-protection requirements may differ across jurisdictions.\n<br>\n<br>Where additional requirements apply to a particular client, project, or geographic market, they may be addressed through supplemental notices, contractual terms, or other appropriate measures.\n<br>\n<br>15. Business Clients &amp; Data Processing Responsibilities\n<br>Some Neutral3rd services involve processing information on behalf of business clients.\n<br>\n<br>The applicable statement of work, service agreement, data-processing agreement, or other written instructions may establish additional obligations.\n<br>\n<br>Business clients remain responsible for providing lawful instructions, identifying authorized data sources, securing necessary permissions, and issuing appropriate privacy notices for their own customer-facing services.\n<br>\n<br>Neutral3rd's responsibilities depend on the agreed scope and actual allocation of control over the relevant information.\n<br>\n<br>16. Changes to This Privacy Policy\n<br>We may update this Privacy Policy to reflect changes in our operations, technologies, service providers, or legal obligations.\n<br>\n<br>The revised policy will display an updated date.\n<br>\n<br>When a change materially affects how personal information is handled, we will provide additional notice or obtain consent when legally required.\n<br>\n<br>17. Contact the Privacy Officer\n<br>For privacy inquiries, access requests, corrections, deletion requests, or concerns about personal information:\n<br>\n<br>Email: privacy@neutral3rd.space\n<br>Website: <a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-secondary\">https://neutral3rd.space</a>\n<br>\n<br>For general technical assistance and customer support:\n<br>\n<br><a href=\"https://clientsupport.neutral3rd.space/portal/en/home\" class=\"text-secondary\" target=\"_blank\">https://clientsupport.neutral3rd.space/portal/en/home</a>\n<br>\n<br>Questions are welcomed about how personal information is handled, and Neutral3rd aims to address privacy concerns transparently and responsibly.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vyYeONPpQk",
          "_anchor": "article04-40",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "position": "relative",
            "overflow": "hidden",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".container-fluid": {
              "padding-left": "clamp(24px, 5vw, 100px)",
              "padding-right": "clamp(24px, 5vw, 100px)"
            },
            ".n3-footer-main": {
              "align-items": "flex-start",
              "row-gap": "30px"
            },
            ".content-wrapper": {
              "max-width": "900px",
              "margin-bottom": "64px",
              "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "20px"
              }
            },
            ".title-wrapper": {
              "margin-bottom": "0"
            },
            ".title-wrap": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "flex-wrap": "wrap",
              "gap": "20px"
            },
            ".logo-wrapper": {
              "display": "block",
              "width": "100%",
              "max-width": "(@logoWidth * 1px)",
              "margin-bottom": "8px"
            },
            ".logo-wrapper img, .n3-footer-logo": {
              "display": "block",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "auto",
              "max-width": "100%",
              "min-width": "0",
              "object-fit": "contain",
              "object-position": "left center",
              "border-radius": "0"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#f9f6ea",
              "margin": "0"
            },
            ".text-wrapper": {
              "margin-top": "12px"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "display": "block",
              "width": "100%",
              "max-width": "650px",
              "margin": "0",
              "color": "#ffffff",
              "font-size": "0.95rem",
              "line-height": "1.6",
              "letter-spacing": "0.02em"
            },
            ".desc-wrapper": {
              "position": "relative",
              "margin-top": "32px",
              "padding-top": "28px"
            },
            ".desc-wrapper::before": {
              "content": "''",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "left": "0",
              "width": "64px",
              "height": "3px",
              "background-color": "#c75423"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#f9f6ea",
              "margin-bottom": "16px"
            },
            ".desc-wrap": {
              "width": "100%"
            },
            ".mbr-desc": {
              "display": "block",
              "width": "(@descWidth * 1%)",
              "max-width": "760px",
              "margin": "0",
              "color": "#c6c3bd",
              "line-height": "1.85",
              "font-size": "clamp(0.95rem, 1.1vw, 1.08rem)",
              "letter-spacing": "0.005em"
            },
            ".mbr-section-btn": {
              "margin-top": "28px",
              "margin-bottom": "0"
            },
            ".mbr-section-btn .btn": {
              "border-color": "#c75423",
              "color": "#ffffff",
              "background-color": "#c75423",
              "border-radius": "3px",
              "padding": "14px 24px",
              "transition": "background-color 0.2s ease"
            },
            ".mbr-section-btn .btn:hover": {
              "background-color": "#a8421c",
              "border-color": "#a8421c",
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".navigation-wrap": {
              "width": "100%",
              "padding-top": "18px"
            },
            ".nav-wrapper": {
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "flex-end",
              "align-items": "flex-start",
              "flex-wrap": "wrap",
              "gap": "32px 44px",
              "margin-bottom": "64px",
              "& when (@reverseContent)": {
                "justify-content": "flex-start"
              }
            },
            ".nav-wrap": {
              "min-width": "150px"
            },
            ".nav-wrap .list": {
              "list-style-type": "none",
              "padding": "0",
              "margin": "0",
              "color": "#e4e3dc"
            },
            ".nav-wrap .item-wrap": {
              "position": "relative",
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "padding": "0 22px 0 20px",
              "margin-bottom": "20px",
              "font-size": "0.85rem",
              "line-height": "1.5",
              "transition": "color 0.2s ease",
              "& when (@showArrow)": {
                "&::after": {
                  "content": "'→'",
                  "position": "absolute",
                  "right": "0",
                  "top": "0",
                  "font-size": "18px",
                  "transform": "rotate(-45deg)"
                }
              }
            },
            ".nav-wrap .item-wrap:last-child": {
              "margin-bottom": "0"
            },
            ".nav-wrap .item-wrap::before": {
              "content": "''",
              "position": "absolute",
              "left": "0",
              "top": "0.35em",
              "width": "9px",
              "height": "9px",
              "border": "1px solid @markerColor",
              "background-color": "transparent",
              "transition": "background-color 0.2s ease"
            },
            ".nav-wrap .item-wrap:hover": {
              "color": "@markerColor"
            },
            ".nav-wrap .item-wrap:hover::before": {
              "background-color": "@markerColor"
            },
            ".nav-wrap a": {
              "color": "inherit",
              "text-decoration": "none"
            },
            ".nav-wrap a:hover": {
              "color": "#c75423"
            },
            ".mbr-copy": {
              "padding": "26px 24px",
              "margin-bottom": "0",
              "background-color": "@cardBg",
              "border-top": "1px solid @cardBorder",
              "border-bottom": "1px solid @cardBorder",
              "color": "#ffffff",
              "text-align": "center",
              "font-size": "0.85rem",
              "line-height": "1.6"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 1199px)": {
              ".nav-wrapper": {
                "gap": "26px"
              },
              ".nav-wrap": {
                "min-width": "125px"
              },
              ".mbr-desc": {
                "font-size": "1rem"
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
              ".content-wrapper": {
                "max-width": "100%"
              },
              ".logo-wrapper": {
                "max-width": "360px"
              },
              ".mbr-desc": {
                "width": "100%",
                "max-width": "720px"
              },
              ".navigation-wrap": {
                "padding-top": "8px"
              },
              ".nav-wrapper": {
                "justify-content": "flex-start",
                "gap": "30px 48px",
                "margin-bottom": "36px"
              },
              ".desc-wrapper": {
                "margin-top": "28px"
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 575px)": {
              ".container-fluid": {
                "padding-left": "20px",
                "padding-right": "20px"
              },
              ".logo-wrapper": {
                "max-width": "290px",
                "margin-bottom": "6px"
              },
              ".text-wrapper": {
                "margin-top": "8px"
              },
              ".mbr-text": {
                "font-size": "0.85rem",
                "line-height": "1.6"
              },
              ".desc-wrapper": {
                "margin-top": "24px",
                "padding-top": "24px"
              },
              ".desc-wrapper::before": {
                "width": "48px"
              },
              ".mbr-desc": {
                "width": "100%",
                "font-size": "0.95rem",
                "line-height": "1.75"
              },
              ".nav-wrapper": {
                "gap": "24px 18px",
                "margin-bottom": "30px"
              },
              ".nav-wrap": {
                "min-width": "0",
                "flex": "1 1 135px"
              },
              ".nav-wrap .item-wrap": {
                "padding-right": "14px",
                "margin-bottom": "14px",
                "font-size": "0.78rem",
                "overflow-wrap": "anywhere"
              },
              ".mbr-copy": {
                "padding": "20px 14px",
                "font-size": "0.75rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-desc, .desc-wrap": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .text-wrapper": {
              "color": "#fff"
            }
          },
          "_name": "footer01",
          "_sourceTheme": "impactm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"footer01 impactm5\" group=\"Footer\" global once=\"footers\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Logo\" name=\"showLogo\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Description\" name=\"showDesc\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Navigation\" name=\"showNav\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Navigation Amount\" name=\"listAmount\" min=\"1\" max=\"3\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"showNav\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Marker Color\" value=\"#c75423\" name=\"markerColor\" condition=\"showNav\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Arrow\" name=\"showArrow\" condition=\"showNav\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Copyright\" name=\"showCopy\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Copyright BG\" value=\"#161617\" name=\"cardBg\" condition=\"showCopy\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" value=\"#353535\" name=\"cardBorder\" condition=\"showCopy\">\n\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#101012\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#101012\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\n        <header>Neutral3rd Layout</header>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Logo Width\" name=\"logoWidth\" min=\"180\" max=\"520\" step=\"10\" value=\"360\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Description Width %\" name=\"descWidth\" min=\"60\" max=\"100\" step=\"5\" value=\"60\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center n3-footer-main\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse': reverseContent}\">\n\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-7\" mbr-if=\"showLogo || showTitle || showSubtitle || showButtons || showText || showDesc\">\n\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n\n                    <div class=\"title-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showLogo || showTitle\">\n                        <div class=\"title-wrap\">\n\n                            <div class=\"logo-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showLogo\">\n                                <a href=\"https://neutral3rd.space\"><img class=\"n3-footer-logo\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/bold20n320geometric20logo-1-512x512.png\" alt=\"Neutral3rd Emerging Tech Development Studio\"></a>\n                            </div>\n\n                           <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .title-wrapper, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                                <b>Neutral3rd</b>\n                            </h2>\n\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- <div class=\"text-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .text-wrapper\">xx</p>\n                    </div> -->\n\n                    <div class=\"desc-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle || showDesc || showButtons\">\n\n                       <!-- <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\">\n                            <b>ABOUT THE STUDIO</b>\n                        </h3> -->\n\n                        <div class=\"desc-wrap\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\">\n                            <p class=\"mbr-desc mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-desc, .desc-wrap\"><b>Neutral3rd</b> helps small businesses and independent professionals put AI to work within real human work. Led by Renée Leach and supported by an army of customized AI assistants, co-pilots, and agents, this studio brings strategy, development, workflows, and AI-powered media together with a \"human STILL in-the-loop\" to make work more capable without making it more complicated.<br></p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"mailto:renee.leach@neutral3rd.space?subject=Business%20Inquiry\">\n                                CONTACT NOW\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-5\" mbr-if=\"showNav\">\n                <div class=\"navigation-wrap\">\n                    <div class=\"nav-wrapper\">\n\n                        <div class=\"nav-wrap\">\n                            <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                                <li class=\"item-wrap\"><b><a href=\"https://neutral3rd.space/privacy\" class=\"text-info\">PRIVACY</a></b></li><a href=\"privacy.html\" class=\"text-primary\"><b>\n                                </b></a><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b><a href=\"https://neutral3rd.space/terms\" class=\"text-info\">TERMS OF SERVICE</a></b></li><a href=\"https://neutral3rd.space/terms\" class=\"text-primary\">\n                                </a><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b><a href=\"https://neutral3rd.space/accessibility\" class=\"text-info\">ACCESSIBILITY</a></b></li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b><a href=\"https://connections.neutral3rd.space/wall\" class=\"text-info\" target=\"_blank\">LEAVE YOUR FEEDBACK</a></b></li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"nav-wrap\" mbr-if=\"listAmount > 1\">\n                            <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                                <li class=\"item-wrap\"><b><a href=\"https://offerbeacon.neutral3rd.space/\" class=\"text-info\" target=\"_blank\">HELP THE RIGHT BUYERS FIND YOU</a></b></li>\n<li class=\"item-wrap\"><b><a href=\"https://neutral3rd.space/custom-task-prompt\" class=\"text-info text-primary\">FROM MY WILDEST DREAMS</a></b></li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b><a href=\"https://perspectives.neutral3rd.space/\" class=\"text-info\" target=\"_blank\">NEUTRAL3RD PERSPECTIVES</a></b></li><a href=\"https://neutral3rd.space\" class=\"text-primary\">\n</a><li class=\"item-wrap\"><b><a href=\"mailto:renee.leach@neutral3rd.space?subject=Business%20Inquiry\" class=\"text-info\">EMAIL RENEE</a></b></li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"nav-wrap\" mbr-if=\"listAmount > 2\">\n                            <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                                <li class=\"item-wrap\"><b>YOUTUBE</b></li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <p class=\"mbr-copy mbr-fonts-style card-wrap\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-copy\" mbr-if=\"showCopy\">\n                    © 2026 Neutral3rd Emerging Tech Development Studio. Operated by U.S.-based business entity, Rowdy Independents LLC. All Rights Reserved.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_cid": "vyYeEnXAc4",
          "_anchor": "footer",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": true,
          "_once": "footers",
          "_params": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    "terms.html": {
      "settings": {
        "title": "Terms of Service | Neutral3rd Emerging Tech Development Studio",
        "meta_descr": "Review Neutral3rd's Terms of Service covering website use, AI solutions, consulting, digital products, payments, intellectual property, and client responsibilities.",
        "header_custom": "",
        "footer_custom": "<style>\n/* Neutral3rd: Basic Image Protection */\nimg {\n  -webkit-user-drag: none;\n  user-drag: none;\n  -webkit-touch-callout: none;\n}\n</style>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  \"use strict\";\n\n  // Prevent the image-specific right-click menu.\n  document.addEventListener(\"contextmenu\", function (event) {\n    if (event.target.closest(\"img, picture\")) {\n      event.preventDefault();\n    }\n  });\n\n  // Prevent dragging images onto the desktop.\n  document.addEventListener(\"dragstart\", function (event) {\n    if (event.target.closest(\"img, picture\")) {\n      event.preventDefault();\n    }\n  });\n})();\n</script>",
        "html_before": "",
        "socialSharingUrl": "",
        "meta_image": "@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/white20and20orange20n320logo-1206x1206.png",
        "order": "4"
      },
      "components": [
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@sticky)": {
              ".navbar-dropdown": {
                "position": "relative !important"
              },
              "& when (@transparent)": {
                ".navbar-dropdown": {
                  "position": "absolute !important"
                }
              }
            },
            "& when (@sticky)": {
              "z-index": "1000",
              "width": "100%",
              "& when not (@transparent)": {
                "position": "relative",
                "min-height": "110px"
              },
              "nav.navbar": {
                "position": "fixed"
              }
            },
            "& when (@fullWidth)": {
              ".container-fluid": {
                "padding-left": "108px",
                "padding-right": "108px",
                "@media (max-width: 1440px)": {
                  "padding-left": "64px",
                  "padding-right": "64px"
                },
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "padding-left": "16px",
                  "padding-right": "16px"
                }
              }
            },
            ".dropdown-item:before": {
              "font-family": "Moririse2 !important",
              "content": "\"\\e966\"",
              "display": "inline-block",
              "width": "0",
              "position": "absolute",
              "left": "1rem",
              "top": "0.5rem",
              "margin-right": "0.5rem",
              "line-height": "1",
              "font-size": "inherit",
              "vertical-align": "middle",
              "text-align": "center",
              "overflow": "hidden",
              "transform": "scale(0, 1)",
              "transition": "all 0.25s ease-in-out"
            },
            ".dropdown-menu": {
              "padding": "0",
              "border-radius": "4px",
              "box-shadow": "0 1px 3px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)"
            },
            ".dropdown-item": {
              "border": "2px solid @borderColor",
              "background": "@menuBgColor !important",
              "color": "@primaryColor !important",
              "&:hover, &:focus": {
                "background": "@menuBgColor !important",
                "color": "@primaryColor !important"
              },
              "&:hover span": {
                "color": "white"
              },
              "&:first-child": {
                "border-top-left-radius": "4px",
                "border-top-right-radius": "4px"
              },
              "&:last-child": {
                "border-bottom-left-radius": "4px",
                "border-bottom-right-radius": "4px"
              }
            },
            ".nav-dropdown .link": {
              "padding": "0 0.3em !important",
              "margin": "0.667em 1em !important"
            },
            ".nav-dropdown .link.dropdown-toggle::after": {
              "margin-left": "0.5rem",
              "margin-top": "0.2rem"
            },
            ".nav-link": {
              "position": "relative"
            },
            ".container": {
              "display": "flex",
              "margin": "0 auto",
              "& when not (@collapsed)": {
                "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
                  "flex-wrap": "nowrap"
                }
              },
              "max-width": "1600px"
            },
            ".iconfont-wrapper": {
              "color": "@iconsColor !important",
              "font-size": "1.5rem",
              "transition": "all 0.3s ease-in-out",
              "&:hover": {
                "color": "@activeColor !important"
              }
            },
            ".dropdown-menu, .navbar.opened": {
              "background": "@menuBgColor !important"
            },
            ".nav-item:focus, .nav-link:focus": {
              "outline": "none"
            },
            ".dropdown .dropdown-menu .dropdown-item": {
              "width": "auto",
              "transition": "all 0.25s ease-in-out",
              "&::after": {
                "right": "1.6rem"
              },
              ".mbr-iconfont": {
                "margin-right": "0.5rem",
                "vertical-align": "sub",
                "&:before": {
                  "display": "inline-block",
                  "transform": "scale(1, 1)",
                  "transition": "all 0.25s ease-in-out"
                }
              }
            },
            ".collapsed": {
              ".dropdown-menu .dropdown-item:before": {
                "display": "none"
              },
              ".dropdown .dropdown-menu .dropdown-item": {
                "padding": "0.235em 1.5em 0.235em 1.5em !important",
                "transition": "none",
                "margin": "0 !important"
              }
            },
            ".navbar": {
              "min-height": "110px",
              "transition": "all 0.3s",
              "border-bottom": "1px solid transparent",
              "&:not(.navbar-short)": {},
              "& when not (@transparent)": {
                "box-shadow": "0 1px 3px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)",
                "background": "@menuBgColor"
              },
              "& when (@transparent)": {
                "background": "rgba(red(@menuBgColor), green(@menuBgColor), blue(@menuBgColor), @opacity)"
              },
              "&.opened": {
                "transition": "all 0.3s"
              },
              ".dropdown-item": {
                "padding": "0.5rem 3.2rem 0.5rem 1.8rem",
                "border-radius": "0"
              },
              ".navbar-logo img": {
                "width": "auto",
                "border-radius": "6px !important"
              },
              ".navbar-collapse": {
                "justify-content": "flex-end",
                "z-index": "1"
              },
              "&.collapsed": {
                "justify-content": "center",
                ".nav-item .nav-link::before": {
                  "display": "none"
                },
                "&.opened": {
                  ".dropdown-menu": {
                    "top": "0"
                  },
                  "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
                    "&:not(.navbar-short) .navbar-collapse when (@showLogo)": {
                      "max-height": "~\"calc(98.5vh - @{logoSize}rem)\""
                    }
                  }
                },
                ".dropdown-menu": {
                  ".dropdown-submenu": {
                    "left": "0 !important"
                  },
                  ".dropdown-item:after": {
                    "right": "auto"
                  },
                  ".dropdown-toggle[data-toggle=\"dropdown-submenu\"]:after": {
                    "margin-left": "0.5rem",
                    "margin-top": "0.2rem",
                    "border-top": "0.35em solid",
                    "border-right": "0.35em solid transparent",
                    "border-left": "0.35em solid transparent",
                    "border-bottom": "0",
                    "top": "41%"
                  }
                },
                "ul.navbar-nav": {
                  "li": {
                    "margin": "auto"
                  }
                },
                ".dropdown-menu .dropdown-item": {
                  "padding": "0.25rem 1.5rem",
                  "text-align": "center"
                },
                ".icons-menu": {
                  "padding-left": "0",
                  "padding-right": "0",
                  "padding-top": "0.5rem",
                  "padding-bottom": "0.5rem"
                }
              },
              "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
                ".nav-item .nav-link::before": {
                  "display": "none"
                },
                "&.opened": {
                  ".dropdown-menu": {
                    "top": "0"
                  }
                },
                ".dropdown-menu": {
                  ".dropdown-submenu": {
                    "left": "0 !important"
                  },
                  ".dropdown-item:after": {
                    "right": "auto"
                  },
                  ".dropdown-toggle[data-toggle=\"dropdown-submenu\"]:after": {
                    "margin-left": "0.5rem",
                    "margin-top": "0.2rem",
                    "border-top": "0.35em solid",
                    "border-right": "0.35em solid transparent",
                    "border-left": "0.35em solid transparent",
                    "border-bottom": "0",
                    "top": "40%"
                  }
                },
                ".navbar-logo": {
                  "img": {
                    "height": "3rem !important"
                  }
                },
                "ul.navbar-nav": {
                  "li": {
                    "margin": "auto"
                  }
                },
                ".dropdown-menu .dropdown-item": {
                  "padding": "0.25rem 1.5rem !important",
                  "text-align": "center"
                },
                ".navbar-brand": {
                  "flex-shrink": "initial",
                  "flex-basis": "auto",
                  "word-break": "break-word",
                  "padding-right": "0.5rem",
                  "max-width": "80%"
                },
                ".navbar-toggler": {
                  "flex-basis": "auto"
                },
                ".icons-menu": {
                  "padding-left": "0",
                  "padding-top": "0.5rem",
                  "padding-bottom": "0.5rem"
                }
              },
              "&.navbar-short": {
                "min-height": "96px",
                ".navbar-brand": {
                  "min-height": "96px"
                }
              },
              "padding": "0 !important",
              "border-radius": "0 !important",
              "border": "none !important",
              "box-shadow": "none !important"
            },
            ".navbar-brand": {
              "min-height": "96px",
              "flex-shrink": "0",
              "align-items": "center",
              "margin-right": "0",
              "padding": "10px 0",
              "transition": "all 0.3s",
              "word-break": "break-word !important",
              "z-index": "1",
              ".navbar-caption": {
                "line-height": "inherit !important",
                "font-weight": "400",
                "&:hover, &:focus": {
                  "color": "@activeColor !important"
                }
              },
              ".navbar-logo a": {
                "outline": "none"
              },
              "word-wrap": "break-word !important",
              "white-space": "normal"
            },
            ".navbar.opened": {
              ".navbar-brand": {
                ".navbar-caption": {
                  "&:hover, &:focus": {
                    "color": "@activeColor !important"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".dropdown-item.active, .dropdown-item:active": {
              "background-color": "transparent"
            },
            ".navbar-expand-lg .navbar-nav .nav-link": {
              "padding": "0"
            },
            ".nav-dropdown .link.dropdown-toggle": {
              "margin-right": "1.667em",
              "&[aria-expanded=\"true\"]": {
                "margin-right": "0",
                "padding": "0.667em 1.667em"
              }
            },
            ".navbar.navbar-expand-lg .dropdown": {
              ".dropdown-menu": {
                "background": "@menuBgColor",
                "top": "3rem",
                "border-radius": "0",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "top": "0"
                },
                ".dropdown-submenu": {
                  "margin": "0",
                  "left": "100%",
                  "top": "0",
                  "border-left": "1px solid transparent"
                }
              }
            },
            ".navbar .dropdown.open > .dropdown-menu": {
              "display": "block"
            },
            "ul.navbar-nav": {
              "flex-wrap": "wrap",
              "@media (min-width: 991px)": {
                "padding": "0",
                "background-color": "transparent",
                "border": "2px solid @borderColor",
                "& when (@collapsed)": {
                  "border-radius": "0 !important"
                }
              }
            },
            ".navbar-buttons": {
              "text-align": "center",
              ".btn": {
                "white-space": "nowrap",
                "margin-right": "0",
                "padding": "22px 32px",
                "min-height": "auto",
                ".mbr-iconfont": {
                  "width": "32px",
                  "height": "32px",
                  "min-width": "32px",
                  "font-size": "16px",
                  "margin-left": "32px",
                  "margin-right": "-20px"
                },
                "@media (max-width: 575px)": {
                  "width": "auto !important"
                }
              }
            },
            "button.navbar-toggler": {
              "outline": "none",
              "width": "50px",
              "height": "50px",
              "cursor": "pointer",
              "transition": "all 0.2s",
              "position": "relative",
              "align-self": "center",
              "border-radius": "100%",
              "background-color": "@menuBgColor !important",
              "border": "none !important",
              "box-shadow": "none !important",
              ".hamburger span": {
                "position": "absolute",
                "right": "0",
                "width": "20px",
                "height": "2px",
                "border-right": "5px",
                "background-color": "@hamburgerColor",
                "&:nth-child(1)": {
                  "top": "18px",
                  "left": "15px",
                  "transition": "all 0.2s"
                },
                "&:nth-child(2)": {
                  "left": "15px",
                  "top": "24px",
                  "transition": "all 0.15s"
                },
                "&:nth-child(3)": {
                  "left": "15px",
                  "top": "24px",
                  "transition": "all 0.15s"
                },
                "&:nth-child(4)": {
                  "left": "15px",
                  "top": "30px",
                  "transition": "all 0.2s"
                }
              }
            },
            "nav.opened .hamburger span": {
              "&:nth-child(1)": {
                "top": "8px",
                "width": "0",
                "opacity": "0",
                "right": "50%",
                "transition": "all 0.2s"
              },
              "&:nth-child(2)": {
                "transform": "rotate(45deg)",
                "transition": "all 0.25s"
              },
              "&:nth-child(3)": {
                "transform": "rotate(-45deg)",
                "transition": "all 0.25s"
              },
              "&:nth-child(4)": {
                "top": "8px",
                "width": "0",
                "opacity": "0",
                "right": "50%",
                "transition": "all 0.2s"
              }
            },
            ".navbar-dropdown": {
              "padding": "0 1rem",
              "& when (@sticky)": {
                "position": "fixed"
              }
            },
            "a.nav-link": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "justify-content": "center"
            },
            ".icons-menu": {
              "flex-wrap": "nowrap",
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "padding-left": "1rem",
              "padding-right": "1rem",
              "padding-top": "0.3rem",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            "@media screen and (~'-ms-high-contrast: active'), (~'-ms-high-contrast: none')": {
              ".navbar": {
                "height": "70px",
                "&.opened": {
                  "height": "auto"
                }
              },
              ".nav-item .nav-link:hover::before": {
                "width": "175%",
                "max-width": "calc(100% ~\"+\" 2rem)",
                "left": "-1rem"
              }
            },
            ".navbar-nav": {
              "margin": "0 auto",
              "& when not (@showButtons)": {
                "justify-content": "flex-end",
                "margin": "0"
              }
            },
            ".nav-item": {
              "padding": "0",
              "margin": "0",
              ".nav-link": {
                "padding": "24px 32px !important",
                "margin": "0 !important",
                "transition": "all 0.3s ease-in-out",
                "font-weight": "400",
                "&::after": {
                  "color": "@activeColor !important",
                  "transform": "rotate(0)",
                  "transition": ".3s"
                },
                "&:hover": {
                  "background-color": "transparent",
                  "color": "@activeColor !important"
                }
              },
              ".nav-link.show": {
                "&::after": {
                  "transform": "rotate(180deg)"
                }
              },
              ".dropdown-menu": {
                "background-color": "transparent !important",
                "&:hover": {
                  "background-color": "transparent !important"
                },
                ".dropdown-item": {
                  "color": "@primaryColor !important",
                  "&:hover": {
                    "color": "@activeColor !important"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "& when (@collapsed)": {
              ".navbar": {
                "justify-content": "flex-start !important"
              },
              ".navbar.opened": {
                "min-height": "100vh !important",
                "justify-content": "flex-start !important"
              },
              ".navbar-collapse": {
                "padding": "20px 0 5rem",
                ".navbar-nav": {
                  "width": "100%",
                  "margin-bottom": "40px"
                },
                ".nav-item": {
                  "width": "100%",
                  "margin": "0",
                  "&:not(:first-child)": {
                    "border-top": "1px solid hsla(0, 0%, 100%, 0.2)"
                  },
                  ".nav-link": {
                    "padding": "14px !important",
                    "justify-content": "center"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
              ".navbar": {
                "justify-content": "flex-start !important"
              },
              ".navbar.opened": {
                "min-height": "100vh !important",
                "flex-direction": "column !important",
                "justify-content": "flex-start !important"
              },
              ".navbar-collapse": {
                "padding": "20px 0 3rem",
                ".navbar-nav": {
                  "width": "100%",
                  "margin-bottom": "24px"
                },
                ".nav-item": {
                  "width": "100%",
                  "margin": "0",
                  "&:not(:first-child)": {
                    "border-top": "1px solid hsla(0, 0%, 100%, 0.2)"
                  },
                  ".nav-link": {
                    "padding": "14px !important",
                    "justify-content": "center"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".content-wrap": {
              "min-height": "130px"
            }
          },
          "_name": "menu01",
          "_sourceTheme": "glancem5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"menu menu01 glancem5\" group=\"Menu\" plugins=\"DropDown, TouchSwipe\" always-top global once=\"menu\" not-draggable position-absolute>\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Logo\" name=\"showLogo\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" title=\"Logo Size\" inline name=\"logoSize\" min=\"3\" max=\"8\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"8\" condition=\"showLogo\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Brand Name\" name=\"showBrand\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Menu Items\" name=\"showItems\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Active Color\" name=\"activeColor\" value=\"#c75423\" condition=\"showItems\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" name=\"borderColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"showItems\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Icons\" name=\"showIcons\">\n        <select title=\"Amount\" name=\"iconsAmount\" condition=\"showIcons\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\" selected>2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icons Color\" name=\"iconsColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"showIcons\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Button\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <header>Styles</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Sticky\" name=\"sticky\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Collapsed\" name=\"collapsed\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Transparent\" name=\"transparent\">\n        <input type=\"range\" title=\"Opacity\" name=\"opacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"transparent\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"menuBgColor\" value=\"#101012\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Hamburger\" name=\"hamburgerColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <nav class=\"navbar navbar-dropdown\" mbr-class=\"{'navbar-fixed-top':sticky,\n                     'navbar-expand-lg':!collapsed,\n                     'collapsed':collapsed}\">\n        <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\" class=\"content-wrap\">\n            <div class=\"navbar-brand\">\n                <span mbr-if=\"showLogo\" class=\"navbar-logo\">\n                    <a href=\"https://neutral3rd.space\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/white20and20orange20n320logo-1206x1206.png\" alt=\"Neutral3rd Emerging Tech Development Studio\" mbr-style=\"{'height': logoSize + 'rem'}\">\n                    </a>\n                </span>\n                <span mbr-if=\"showBrand\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" class=\"navbar-caption-wrap\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd,-mbrBtnRemove,-iconFont\"><a class=\"navbar-caption text-info\" data-app-selector=\".navbar-caption\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">GlanceM5</a></span>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"navbar-toggler\" type=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#navbarSupportedContent\" data-bs-target=\"#navbarSupportedContent\" aria-controls=\"navbarNavAltMarkup\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation\" mbr-if=\"showItems || showIcons || showButtons\">\n                <div class=\"hamburger\">\n                    <span></span>\n                    <span></span>\n                    <span></span>\n                    <span></span>\n                </div>\n            </button>\n            <div class=\"collapse navbar-collapse\" id=\"navbarSupportedContent\" mbr-if=\"showItems || showIcons || showButtons\">\n                <ul mbr-menu class=\"navbar-nav nav-dropdown\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showItems\" mbr-class=\"{'nav-right': !showButtons,'navbar-nav-top-padding': isPublish && !showBrand && !showLogo}\"><li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link link text-info text-primary\" href=\"https://offerbeacon.neutral3rd.space\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">OfferBeacon Suite</a></li><li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link link text-info text-primary\" href=\"https://neutral3rd.space/custom-task-prompt\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">From My Wildest Dreams</a></li>\n                    \n                    <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link link text-info text-primary\" href=\"index.html#dev-about\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">About</a>\n                    </li></ul>\n                <div class=\"icons-menu\" mbr-if=\"showIcons\">\n                    <a class=\"iconfont-wrapper\" href=\"index.html\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"p-2 mbr-iconfont socicon-bluesky socicon\"></span>\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"iconfont-wrapper\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" target=\"_blank\" mbr-if=\"iconsAmount > 1\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"p-2 mbr-iconfont socicon-twitter socicon\"></span>\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"iconfont-wrapper\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" target=\"_blank\" mbr-if=\"iconsAmount > 2\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"p-2 mbr-iconfont socicon-instagram socicon\"></span>\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"iconfont-wrapper\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" target=\"_blank\" mbr-if=\"iconsAmount > 3\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"p-2 mbr-iconfont socicon-linkedin socicon\"></span>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                <div mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"navbar-buttons mbr-section-btn\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://studioguide.neutral3rd.space/chat?token=cf7573456c87d54489c7ba5f0a2e93bf&name=Samir%20%7C%20Neutral3rd%20Emerging%20Tech%20Development%20Studio&accent=%23c75423&greet=Hey!%20Welcome%20to%20Neutral3rd.%20I%27m%20Samir%2C%20Neutral3rd%27s%20AI%20studio%20guide.%20I%20can%20help%20you%20explore%20the%20OfferBeacon%20Suite%2C%20learn%20about%20this%20development%20studio%20in%20general%2C%20or%20find%20the%20right%20next%20step.%20What%20brings%20you%20here%20today%3F&face=https%3A%2F%2Fcuevueapp.com%2Fassets%2Ffaces%2Fstandard%2F62227bb3-2f6e-4220-b3c9-2c02b2fdb349.jpg&page=https%3A%2F%2Fstudioguide.neutral3rd.space%2Fneutral3rd-emerging-technologies%2Fsamir-from-neutral3rd-emerging&mode=desktop&lang=en\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Start a Conversation</a></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vyZtqaroJI",
          "_anchor": "menu01-41",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": true,
          "_once": "menu",
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)",
              "& when (@overlay)": {
                ".mbr-overlay": {
                  "background": "@overlayColor",
                  "opacity": "@overlayOpacity"
                }
              }
            },
            "& when (@fullWidth)": {
              ".container-fluid": {
                "padding": "0 32px",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "padding": "0 24px"
                }
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
              ".container": {
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "padding": "0 24px"
                }
              }
            },
            ".card": {
              "justify-content": "center"
            },
            ".title-wrapper": {
              "padding": "0 32px 32px",
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "padding": "0 24px 24px"
              },
              ".mbr-section-title": {
                "margin-bottom": "16px"
              },
              ".mbr-desc": {
                "margin-bottom": "0"
              }
            },
            ".text-wrapper": {
              "border-top": "1px solid @border",
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "space-between",
              "padding": "32px",
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "display": "block",
                "padding": "24px"
              },
              ".mbr-text": {
                "width": "45%",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "width": "100%",
                  "margin-bottom": "24px",
                  "&:last-child": {
                    "margin-bottom": "0"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#F9F6E0"
            },
            ".mbr-desc": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".mbr-section-btn": {
              "text-align": "right"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            }
          },
          "_name": "article04",
          "_sourceTheme": "fabm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article04 fabm5\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Description\" name=\"showDesc\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text 1\" name=\"showText_1\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text 2\" name=\"showText_2\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" value=\"#72716b\" name=\"border\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax required>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#000000\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.1\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showDesc\">\n                <div class=\"title-wrapper\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                        <b>Terms of Service</b></h2>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-desc mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-desc\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\">\n                        <a href=\"https://neutral3rd.space\" class=\"text-warning\">Neutral3rd Emerging Tech Development Studio</a>\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText_1\">Effective Date: July 24, 2026<br>Last Updated: November 17, 2026<br><br>1. Acceptance of Terms\n<br>Welcome to Neutral3rd.\n<br>\n<br>These Terms of Service (\"Terms\") govern your access to and use of the Neutral3rd website, information, digital products, demonstrations, and services made available directly by Neutral3rd.\n<br>\n<br>By accessing or using our website or purchasing our products or services, you agree to these Terms, to the extent permitted by applicable law.\n<br>\n<br>If you do not agree, please discontinue use of all applicable Neutral3rd websites and services.\n<br>\n<br>If you are acting on behalf of a business or organization, you represent that you have the authority to enter into applicable agreements on its behalf.\n<br>\n<br>2. About Neutral3rd\n<br>Neutral3rd is an independent emerging technologies development studio focused on practical technology solutions for real-world business needs.\n<br>\n<br>Offerings may include:\n<br>\n<br>- AI enablement and implementation.\n<br>- Conversational AI solutions and business information guides.\n<br>- Workflow and process automation.\n<br>- Software and web technology development.\n<br>- Digital communications and content systems.\n<br>- Accessibility and usability consulting.\n<br>- Technical training, education, and documentation.\n<br>- Prompt packs, templates, and other digital resources.\n<br>- Custom technology configuration, testing, and ongoing support.\n<br><br>Descriptions on this website are informational and do not guarantee the availability of any particular service, integration, capability, or commercial arrangement.\n<br>\n<br>3. Website Use\n<br>You may access and use publicly available website content for lawful informational and business purposes.\n<br>\n<br>You agree not to:\n<br>\n<br>- Attempt unauthorized access to systems, accounts, or data.\n<br>- Interfere with website functionality or security.\n<br>- Introduce malicious code or harmful automated traffic.\n<br>- Misrepresent your identity or authority.\n<br>- Use the website to violate applicable law.\n<br>- Copy, distribute, or commercially exploit protected content without authorization.\n<br>- Attempt to circumvent service restrictions or technical safeguards.\n<br>- Use our services to infringe intellectual property, privacy, or other legal rights.\n<br><br>We may restrict access or take other appropriate action in response to suspected misuse.\n<br>\n<br>4. Service Proposals &amp; Client Agreements\n<br>Descriptions, demonstrations, estimates, and website materials do not constitute a binding commitment to deliver a specific project.\n<br>\n<br>Professional services may require a separate proposal, statement of work, order form, subscription agreement, or other written contract.\n<br>\n<br>Such documents may specify:\n<br>\n<br>- Project scope and deliverables.\n<br>- Implementation milestones and schedules.\n<br>- Client responsibilities.\n<br>- Fees and payment terms.\n<br>- Revision allowances.\n<br>- Acceptance procedures.\n<br>- Support and maintenance coverage.\n<br>- Third-party dependencies.\n<br>- Intellectual property rights.\n<br>- Confidentiality and data handling.\n<br>- Cancellation and termination conditions.\n<br><br>If a separately executed agreement conflicts with these Terms concerning the contracted services, the separately executed agreement will govern that subject matter unless it states otherwise.\n<br>\n<br>5. Fees, Purchases, &amp; Payment\n<br>Prices are displayed or quoted in the applicable offer, invoice, checkout, or agreement.\n<br>\n<br>Unless otherwise specified, prices are in U.S. dollars.\n<br>\n<br>Payment may be collected through an authorized third-party processor.\n<br>\n<br>Applicable taxes, recurring charges, and additional fees will be disclosed as required before purchase.\n<br>\n<br>A payment obligation is not satisfied merely by submitting an order if payment is declined or otherwise unsuccessful.\n<br>\n<br>We may suspend work or withhold undelivered services when required payments are overdue, subject to applicable agreements and law.\n<br>\n<br>5.1 Setup &amp; Implementation Fees\n<br>Setup fees may cover discovery, configuration, content preparation, implementation, testing, and other agreed work.\n<br>\n<br>Where a setup fee applies, the applicable offer or agreement states what it covers and how it is treated if the project is cancelled or the scope changes.\n<br>\n<br>5.2 Recurring Services\n<br>Some services may involve recurring charges for maintenance, monitoring, support, hosting, or other ongoing activities.\n<br>\n<br>The applicable checkout or agreement will specify the billing interval, amount, renewal arrangement, and cancellation procedure.\n<br>\n<br>Cancellation generally affects future billing and does not automatically reverse charges already incurred, except where required by law or the applicable agreement.\n<br>\n<br>5.3 Third-Party Costs\n<br>Clients may be responsible for third-party subscriptions, usage fees, hosting, API charges, transaction fees, or software licenses.\n<br>\n<br>Unless expressly included in a written offer, such costs are separate from Neutral3rd service fees.\n<br>\n<br>5.4 Discounts &amp; Promotion Codes\n<br>A discount applies only to the purchase on which it is entered or pre-filled, and only while it remains valid.\n<br>\n<br>Discounts may be limited by number of uses, by date, or by eligibility. Where a limit is reached or a code is withdrawn, the price shown at checkout applies.\n<br>\n<br>One discount may be used per purchase, and discounts cannot be combined unless the offer says otherwise.\n<br>\n<br>Promotion codes issued for other Neutral3rd products, subscriptions, or offers do not apply to the From My Wildest Dreams project fee. If a checkout accepts a code that was not issued for that offer, we may correct the price, apply the difference to the project, or decline the order and return the amount paid.\n<br>\n<br>A discount never changes the refund and credit terms in section 7.\n<br>\n<br>6. Digital Products &amp; Prompt Packs\n<br>Neutral3rd may sell downloadable resources, prompt collections, templates, educational materials, and other digital products.\n<br>\n<br>Unless the applicable product listing grants different rights, a completed purchase provides a limited, nonexclusive, nontransferable license to use the purchased materials for the purchaser's own personal or internal business purposes.\n<br>\n<br>Purchasing a digital product does not transfer ownership of its underlying intellectual property.\n<br>\n<br>You may adapt purchased prompts and templates for your own authorized work.\n<br>\n<br>Unless expressly permitted in writing, you may not:\n<br>\n<br>- Resell or sublicense the original materials.\n<br>- Redistribute entire packs or substantially equivalent copies.\n<br>- Publish purchased materials as your own competing commercial product.\n<br>- Upload the complete product to a public repository or file-sharing service.\n<br>- Remove proprietary notices or misrepresent authorship.\n<br><br>Outputs produced through third-party AI services remain subject to those services' terms and applicable law.\n<br>\n<br>A Neutral3rd prompt pack does not include an LLM subscription, API credits, or third-party software access unless expressly stated.\n<br>\n<br>7. From My Wildest Dreams\n<br>This section applies to the From My Wildest Dreams project. It is the offer described on the project page and at checkout, and it controls where it differs from the general terms elsewhere in this document.\n<br>\n<br>7.1 What you are buying\n<br>From My Wildest Dreams is a fixed-fee project for one recurring task.\n<br>\n<br>You bring one task you repeat in your business. We write a reusable AI prompt for that task and test it before we meet. In the session we paste it into your own Claude Project, Google Gem, or ChatGPT plugin, run it on your own material, and adjust what does not fit. The prompt is what you are buying. The Project, Gem, or plugin is where you keep it, inside an account you already hold and pay for. The session is one private 90-minute video meeting, recorded, offered Tuesday to Friday in Eastern time and no earlier than three business days after your answers are received. The last ten minutes go on a short written brief for a related task you want to tackle yourself later.\n<br>\n<br>One prompt's worth of work means one task, one kind of input, one kind of output, for one audience; the information the task needs can be supplied to the AI or already sits in your account; and nothing in the task depends on a system we cannot reach. Two outputs, two audiences, or two separate jobs is two projects.\n<br>\n<br>You keep:\n<br>\n<br>- Your master prompt as an editable document.\n<br>- The Prompt Workbench: one completed example from your project and a blank copy for the next one.\n<br>- Your project brief and the session deck prepared for your session.\n<br>- One written Second Look within 30 days, as described in section 7.6.\n<br><br>The fee covers one task, one prompt, and one session. A second task is a second project.\n<br>\n<br>The fee does not include an AI subscription, API credits, third-party software, or work outside the one task you brought.\n<br>\n<br>7.2 Payment, and the questions that open after it\n<br>The project fee is $450. A founding-client code, while it remains available, takes $100 off, for a fee of $350.\n<br>\n<br>Payment is taken before the full questionnaire. The short first form collects your contact details and your consent, and costs nothing. The full questions, which take about ten minutes, open after the payment has gone through.\n<br>\n<br>The payment is collected through Stripe on a single-use payment link tied to your project. That keeps an unpaid request from being used to obtain the questionnaire, and it lets us close a link that belongs to one closed project without affecting anyone else's.\n<br>\n<br>When your answers arrive, we check your brief against what one prompt can be, as defined in section 7.1. That check decides whether the task fits, it happens after payment and after your answers, and you hear the outcome within one business day. Your booking link is sent once the check is confirmed, not before, so you do not book a session for a task we are about to move to credit.\n<br>\n<br>If you have paid and the questions do not arrive, email <a href=\"mailto:renee.leach@neutral3rd.space?subject=From%20My%20Wildest%20Dreams%3A%20Paid.%20no%20project%20brief\" class=\"text-secondary\">renee.leach@neutral3rd.space</a> and we will resend them.\n<br>\n<br>7.3 No cash refunds; credit instead\n<br>To be plain about two things. There is no cash refund once you have paid. The check on whether the task fits happens after payment and after your answers, as section 7.2 describes. If the task turns out not to be one prompt's worth of work, the full fee becomes credit toward a different task, so nothing is lost.\n<br>\n<br>If you would rather ask before you pay, you can, and we will tell you straight whether your task looks like a fit. That conversation is a courtesy, not the check. The check that decides it is the one made on your answers after payment, and section 7.4 describes what happens when it does not pass.\n<br>\n<br>Credit is applied to a different task on the same terms as the original project. It is recorded against the name and email address that paid.\n<br>\n<br>Where a service is not delivered at all, or is materially different from what was described, the remedy is completion, correction, or credit. Nothing in this section removes a right you have under consumer law that cannot be waived.\n<br>\n<br>7.4 If the task is not what I think it is\n<br>Your answers are what the check is made against, and they arrive after payment. If the task turns out to be broader than one prompt, to need more than one output or audience, or to depend on a system we cannot reach, we will tell you in plain words within one business day of your answers.\n<br>\n<br>Where the task does not fit, the remedy is the credit in section 7.3, not a cash refund. The credit applies to a different task, and that task is checked in the same way. If you would rather reshape the task with us than move it, say so in your reply and we will look at what fits.\n<br>\n<br>No booking link is sent for a task that has not passed the check.\n<br>\n<br>7.5 The seven-day refinement window\n<br>If the prompt does not do what the agreed brief describes when you test it in your own account, tell us within seven days of delivery and we will correct the prompt at no charge.\n<br>\n<br>This is a correction of the deliverable. It is not a cash refund.\n<br>\n<br>7.6 The One Second Look\n<br>Within 30 days of delivery, send one draft prompt, one redacted example, and the question you most want our view on.\n<br>\n<br>You receive written feedback covering what is working, the most important problem, up to three edits in priority order, and one test to try next.\n<br>\n<br>The Second Look is capped at thirty minutes of our time and is returned within three business days. It is one per project.\n<br>\n<br><br><br></p>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText_2\">7.7 Unpaid projects close after three days\n<br>A form submission that has not been paid is held for up to three days, with up to three reminders by email during that period.\n<br>\n<br>If payment has not arrived by then, the project is closed. The working folder created for it is removed, any single-use payment link for it is cancelled, and the request is recorded as closed.\n<br>\n<br>You can start again later. The price and the availability of any discount at that time will apply.\n<br>\n<br>7.8 Chargebacks and disputes\n<br>If a card payment is disputed with the issuing bank, work on the project pauses until the dispute is resolved.\n<br>\n<br>We will respond to the dispute with the record of the project: your form answers, the terms you accepted at checkout, the emails sent to you, and any deliverables created.\n<br>\n<br>If the card issuer reverses the payment, the project closes. If the payment is upheld, work continues from where it paused.\n<br>\n<br>A dispute is slower than asking us directly. If something has gone wrong, contact <a href=\"mailto:renee.leach@neutral3rd.space?subject=Payment%20Chargebacks%20%26%20Disputes\" class=\"text-secondary\">renee.leach@neutral3rd.space</a> first.<br><br>8. Digital Product Delivery &amp; Refunds\n<br>Digital product delivery methods, access requirements, and any refund eligibility are described at the point of purchase, in the applicable offer, or in a section such as 7 above.\n<br>\n<br>Because digital materials may be accessible immediately after delivery, certain purchases may have restricted refund eligibility where legally permitted and clearly disclosed before checkout.\n<br>\n<br>Nothing in these Terms eliminates nonwaivable consumer rights or remedies for defective, misdescribed, or undelivered products.\n<br>\n<br>If you experience a delivery problem, contact <a href=\"https://clientsupport.neutral3rd.space/portal/en/home\" class=\"text-secondary\" target=\"_blank\">https://clientsupport.neutral3rd.space/portal/en/home</a> with your order information.\n<br>\n<br>9. AI-Enabled Services &amp; Outputs\n<br>Some Neutral3rd products and services incorporate artificial intelligence, machine learning, retrieval systems, and automated workflows.\n<br>\n<br>These technologies may produce inaccurate, incomplete, outdated, inconsistent, or otherwise unsuitable results.\n<br>\n<br>AI-generated outputs should not be treated as guaranteed factual statements or professional determinations.\n<br>\n<br>9.1 Human Review\n<br>Users and clients are responsible for reviewing AI-generated content before relying on it, publishing it, distributing it, or using it to make consequential decisions.\n<br>\n<br>9.2 High-Impact Decisions\n<br>Unless expressly authorized through a suitable professional and technical arrangement, Neutral3rd AI solutions are not intended to independently make decisions involving medical treatment, legal rights, employment eligibility, credit, insurance, housing, or other similarly consequential matters.\n<br>\n<br>9.3 Third-Party AI Platforms\n<br>AI services may depend on third-party providers whose models, APIs, pricing, policies, features, or availability can change.\n<br>\n<br>Neutral3rd cannot guarantee uninterrupted availability or permanent compatibility with third-party systems.\n<br>\n<br>9.4 No Guaranteed Business Outcomes\n<br>We do not guarantee that an AI solution, automation, prompt pack, or digital service will produce a particular revenue increase, customer conversion rate, search ranking, productivity gain, or other commercial result.\n<br>\n<br>Results depend on implementation, information quality, user behavior, market conditions, and factors outside our control.\n<br>\n<br>10. Client Responsibilities\n<br>Clients agree to provide reasonably accurate and authorized information needed for their projects.\n<br>\n<br>Clients are responsible for:\n<br>\n<br>- Confirming the accuracy of submitted business information.\n<br>Obtaining necessary rights to supplied content, images, documents, and data.\n<br>- Maintaining appropriate access to their own accounts and platforms.\n<br>- Reviewing and approving deliverables where required.\n<br>- Complying with laws applicable to their businesses and industries.\n<br>- Providing required notices and permissions to their own customers.\n<br>- Informing Neutral3rd about material changes affecting a deployed solution.\n<br>- Avoiding submission of restricted or sensitive information through unapproved channels.\n<br>- Delays in supplying required materials or approvals may affect delivery schedules.\n<br>\n<br>11. Client Content &amp; Intellectual Property\n<br>Clients retain their ownership rights in materials they lawfully provide to Neutral3rd.\n<br>\n<br>Clients grant Neutral3rd a limited right to use, reproduce, process, and adapt such materials as reasonably necessary to perform authorized services.\n<br>\n<br>Unless a written agreement provides otherwise, Neutral3rd retains ownership of its preexisting intellectual property, reusable methods, frameworks, templates, software components, internal tools, and general technical know-how.\n<br>\n<br>Ownership and licensing of custom deliverables will be governed by the applicable project agreement.\n<br>\n<br>Neither party receives ownership of the other's trademarks or other protected intellectual property merely through a business relationship.\n<br>\n<br>12. Confidentiality\n<br>Where Neutral3rd and a client enter into a confidentiality agreement, that agreement governs the information and obligations it covers.\n<br>\n<br>Absent a separate confidentiality agreement, the parties should still avoid unnecessary disclosure of nonpublic business information and use appropriate secure channels for sensitive materials.\n<br>\n<br>Website contact forms and ordinary email should not be assumed to provide the same confidentiality protections as a specifically contracted secure environment.\n<br>\n<br>13. Accessibility &amp; Inclusive Design\n<br>Neutral3rd values accessibility and inclusive digital experiences.\n<br>\n<br>Accessibility requirements for client projects should be established in the applicable project scope, including any required WCAG version, conformance level, assistive technology testing, remediation responsibilities, and acceptance criteria.\n<br>\n<br>Accessibility consulting or development does not automatically constitute an independent certification or legal compliance guarantee.\n<br>\n<br>For accessibility concerns involving our own website, contact <a href=\"https://clientsupport.neutral3rd.space/portal/en/home\" class=\"text-secondary\" target=\"_blank\">https://clientsupport.neutral3rd.space/portal/en/home</a>.\n<br>\n<br>14. Third-Party Services &amp; External Links\n<br>Our website and services may reference or integrate third-party products, websites, payment systems, AI platforms, and other technology providers.\n<br>\n<br>Third-party services are governed by their respective terms, policies, licensing requirements, and availability conditions.\n<br>\n<br>Neutral3rd is not responsible for independent third-party conduct or changes beyond its reasonable control, except to the extent responsibility cannot lawfully be excluded or is expressly assumed under a written agreement.\n<br>\n<br>References to third-party brands do not necessarily indicate endorsement, sponsorship, or affiliation.\n<br>\n<br>15. Demonstrations &amp; Early-Access Offerings\n<br>Neutral3rd may display prototypes, conceptual demonstrations, preview features, or products identified as being in development.\n<br>\n<br>These materials may not reflect a final commercial release.\n<br>\n<br>Early-access features may be modified, delayed, limited, or discontinued.\n<br>\n<br>Participation in an early-access program does not guarantee a specific release date, feature set, or permanent access unless separately agreed in writing.\n<br>\n<br>16. Support &amp; Maintenance\n<br>Support availability and response commitments depend on the purchased service and any applicable maintenance agreement.\n<br>\n<br>Unless a separate agreement establishes specific service levels, website statements about support do not create a guaranteed response time, uptime percentage, or continuous monitoring obligation.\n<br>\n<br>Support requests may be submitted to <a href=\"https://clientsupport.neutral3rd.space/portal/en/home\" class=\"text-secondary\" target=\"_blank\">https://clientsupport.neutral3rd.space/portal/en/home</a>.\n<br>\n<br>17. Privacy &amp; Data Handling\n<br>Our Privacy Policy describes how Neutral3rd handles personal information in connection with its website and applicable services.\n<br>\n<br>Separate client agreements or data-processing arrangements may establish additional responsibilities.\n<br>\n<br>Clients are responsible for ensuring that information submitted for processing has been obtained and disclosed lawfully.\n<br>\n<br>18. Disclaimers\n<br>The website and general informational materials are provided on an \"as available\" basis.\n<br>\n<br>To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, Neutral3rd disclaims implied warranties not expressly provided in a written agreement, including implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and noninfringement.\n<br>\n<br>Nothing in these Terms excludes an express warranty contained in an applicable signed agreement or any warranty that cannot lawfully be disclaimed.\n<br>\n<br>Professional advice in regulated fields should be obtained from appropriately qualified professionals.\n<br>\n<br>19. Limitation of Liability\n<br>To the extent permitted by applicable law, Neutral3rd will not be liable for indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from use of the general website or services, including lost profits, lost opportunities, or business interruption, except where such exclusions are prohibited.\n<br>\n<br>For claims arising solely from general website use and not governed by a separate written agreement, Neutral3rd's aggregate liability will not exceed the amount paid directly to Neutral3rd for the specific website-related service giving rise to the claim during the preceding twelve months, or $100 if no such payment was made, to the extent enforceable.\n<br>\n<br>Separate service agreements may establish different liability terms.\n<br>\n<br>Nothing in these Terms limits liability for fraud, willful misconduct, or other matters for which liability cannot legally be excluded or restricted.\n<br>\n<br>20. Indemnification\n<br>To the extent permitted by law, business users agree to defend and indemnify Neutral3rd against third-party claims arising from their unlawful use of our services, infringement caused by materials they supplied, or material violations of these Terms.\n<br>\n<br>This obligation does not apply to the extent a claim results from Neutral3rd's own unlawful conduct or other responsibility that cannot lawfully be transferred.\n<br>\n<br>Indemnification for professional services is established in the applicable agreement where one is signed.\n<br>\n<br>21. Suspension &amp; Termination\n<br>We may suspend or restrict access where reasonably necessary to address security risks, unlawful activity, material misuse, or a material violation of applicable terms.\n<br>\n<br>Either party may terminate an ongoing service according to the applicable agreement.\n<br>\n<br>Termination does not automatically eliminate outstanding payment obligations, accrued rights, or provisions intended to survive termination.\n<br>\n<br>22. Governing Law &amp; Disputes\n<br>Unless a separate written agreement states otherwise, these Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Georgia, United States, without regard to conflict-of-law principles.\n<br>\n<br>Disputes arising from these Terms will be subject to the courts of competent jurisdiction in the State of Georgia, except where mandatory consumer-protection or other applicable law requires a different forum.\n<br>\n<br>Before commencing formal proceedings, parties are encouraged to contact Neutral3rd and attempt to resolve the matter informally.\n<br>\n<br>These Terms do not require arbitration or waive the right to participate in a class action.\n<br>\n<br>23. Changes to Terms\n<br>We may revise these Terms to reflect operational, technological, legal, or commercial changes.\n<br>\n<br>Updated Terms will be posted with a revised date.\n<br>\n<br>Material changes affecting existing paid agreements will be handled according to applicable contractual and legal requirements.\n<br>\n<br>Changes will not retroactively eliminate rights already accrued under an existing agreement.\n<br>\n<br>24. Severability &amp; Entire Agreement\n<br>If a provision of these Terms is determined to be unenforceable, the remaining provisions will remain effective to the extent legally permissible.\n<br>\n<br>These Terms, together with any applicable policies and separately executed agreements, constitute the relevant agreement governing the covered subject matter.\n<br>\n<br>Failure to enforce a provision on one occasion does not necessarily waive the right to enforce it later.\n<br>\n<br>25. Contact Information\n<br>Neutral3rd Emerging Tech Development Studio\n<br>Website: <a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-secondary\">https://neutral3rd.space</a>\n<br>Support: <a href=\"https://clientsupport.neutral3rd.space/portal/en/home\" class=\"text-secondary\" target=\"_blank\">https://clientsupport.neutral3rd.space/portal/en/home</a>\n<br>Privacy Inquiries: <a href=\"mailto:privacy@neutral3rd.space?subject=Privacy%20Inquiry\" class=\"text-secondary\">privacy@neutral3rd.space</a>\n<br>\n<br>For questions concerning a specific purchase, subscription, or project, please include the relevant order or project reference when contacting support.<br></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
